OL,3,GNEWSAFraudster's friend helped in #722k
OL,4,ACovid loan scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge said Nellis was the "most
OL,7,Fdishonest man" he had come across in
OL,8,Fhis legal career when he jailed him for
OL,9,Falmost 18 years in December, while his
OL,10,Faccomplice Sundeep Chahal remains on
OL,11,Fthe run.
